@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Entry Workflow - Conceptual States and Guards
state "Check new text" as CheckNew <<choice>>
state "Check edited text" as CheckEdit <<choice>>
state "Await delete confirmation" as ConfirmDelete

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Draft : mediaAdded [successful] / stage filename
Draft --> CheckNew : Save
CheckNew --> Draft : [text empty] / show warning
CheckNew --> Persisted : [text non-empty] / append row
Persisted --> Selected : select browse row / populate editor
Selected --> CheckEdit : Save changes
CheckEdit --> Selected : [text empty] / show warning
CheckEdit --> Selected : [text non-empty] / update row; refresh
Selected --> ConfirmDelete : Delete
ConfirmDelete --> Selected : No / leave row unchanged
ConfirmDelete --> Deleted : Yes / remove row; clear selected id
Deleted --> [*]

legend bottom left
  Conceptual UI/persistence workflow, not an implemented state enum.
  Choice guards are mutually exclusive. Selection is required for edit/delete.
  A deleted row's audio file is retained; no media destruction is implied.
  I/O is assumed successful; atomic recovery is a proposed requirement.
endlegend
@enduml
